Example with those services defined (which is the common result when using PSR-4 discovery for your services):

```yaml
defaults:
    autoconfigure: true
    autowire: true
    public: false

services:
    ConcreteClass: ~
    MyInterface: '@ConcreteClass'

    DecoratorClass:
        decorates: ConcreteClass
```

```php
$container->get(MyInterface::class) instanceof MyInterface; // true (DecoratorClass implements MyInterface
$container->get(ConcreteClass::class) instanceof ConcreteClass; // false (DecoratorClass does not extend ConcreteClass)
```

So adding the feature that any id looking like a class/interface name must return an instance of that class would require us to remove features of our container as they are fundamentally incompatible with that requirement.

